## 탐색 결과 보고서: MallCodeMapping 동적 구현을 위한 기존 패턴 분석

### 1. Proxy API 관련 코드 구조

#### 1.1 ProxyApiClient 패턴
**파일**: `/Users/admin/project/integrated-search/outbound/client/proxy-api/src/main/kotlin/com/cowave/search/client/proxy_api/ProxyApiClient.kt`

```kotlin
@Component
class ProxyApiClient(
    @field:Qualifier("ProxyHttpGraphQlClient")
    private val client: HttpGraphQlClient
) {
    fun <T> query(
        query: String,
        variables: Map<String, Any> = emptyMap(),
        retrievePath: String,
        classType: Class<T>,
    ): List<T>
}
```

**특징**:
- GraphQL 클라이언트 기반 (Spring GraphQL)
- 제네릭 `<T>` 타입으로 유연한 응답 처리
- `retrievePath`로 중첩된 응답에서 필요한 데이터 추출
- 예외 처리 및 로깅 포함

#### 1.2 ProxyApiClientConfig 및 Properties
**파일**: `/Users/admin/project/integrated-search/outbound/client/proxy-api/src/main/kotlin/com/cowave/search/client/proxy_api/ProxyApiClientConfig.kt`

```kotlin
@Configuration
class ProxyApiClientConfig(
    private val prop: ProxyApiClientProperties,
) {
    @Bean("ProxyHttpGraphQlClient")
    fun httpGraphQlClient(): HttpGraphQlClient {
        return HttpGraphQlClient.builder(WebClient.create(prop.baseUrl))
            .headers { it.setBasicAuth(prop.username, prop.password) }
            .build()
    }
}
```

**Properties**:
```kotlin
@ConfigurationProperties(prefix = "client.proxy-api")
data class ProxyApiClientProperties(
    val baseUrl: String,
    val username: String,
    val password: String,
)
```

