### 3. Outbound Adapter 패턴 (출력 포트 구현)

#### 3.1 MallRepositoryImpl (MallRepository 구현)
**파일**: `/Users/admin/project/integrated-search/outbound-adapter/proxy/src/main/kotlin/com/cowave/search/outbound_adapter/proxy/MallRepositoryImpl.kt`

```kotlin
@Component
class MallRepositoryImpl(
    private val client: ProxyApiClient,
) : MallRepository {
    override fun findAllByIds(mallIds: List<Int>): List<Mall> {
        val query = """
            query GetMalls(${'$'}ids: [Int!]) {
                malls(input: {  ids: ${'$'}ids }) {
                    items {
                        mallId
                        mallUseYnDanawa
                        mallUseYnEnuri
                    }
                }
            }
        """.trimIndent()

        return client.query(
            query = query,
            variables = mapOf("ids" to mallIds),
            retrievePath = "malls.items",
            Mall::class.java,
        )
    }
}
```

#### 3.2 유사 구현 패턴 (Brand, Category, Manufacturer)

**BrandRepositoryImpl**:
```kotlin
@Component
class BrandRepositoryImpl(private val client: ProxyApiClient) : BrandRepository {
    override fun findAllByIds(brandIds: List<Long>): List<Brand> {
        val query = """
            query GetBrands(${'$'}ids: [Long!]!) {
                brands(input: { ids: ${'$'}ids }) {
                    items { id, name }
                }
            }
        """.trimIndent()
        return client.query(query, mapOf("ids" to brandIds), "brands.items", Brand::class.java)
    }
}
```

